hill they told us we would be  able to pre-order starting thursday this  was august 25th at 11 a.m eastern time  well 11am came and  nothing happened there was no tweet  everybody was refreshing gamestop best  buy amazon all the usual websites  refreshing the hogwarts legacy homepage  and nothing happened for a bit it took  about 10-15 minutes before the hogwarts  legacy website actually updated and they  added this pre-order now section which  is still live at the time of this  recording and if you click on that it  will take you to this page here where  you can choose your edition and then you  can also choose your platform and you  can also choose your store well the  problem is when this first went up you  could not pre-order the deluxe and you  could not pre-order the collectors  anywhere there were no retailers listed  so if we go into the collector's edition  here and i'm just going to choose the  ps5 version right now the only store  listed is gamestop well guess what if  you go to gamestop it's sold out across  the board currently unavailable  completely sold out for the collector's  edition i know james of expecto go was  actually live streaming this and you can  go back and watch his stream and see  this happening in real time him  refreshing the page but a lot of people  were having trouble there i was  fortunate enough to get a pre-order for  the collector's edition in through  gamestop but at the time of this  recording that is still the only store  that has came online for the collector's  edition now i saw some people reporting  that best buy very briefly was selling  the pc collectors edition however  according to the update on the hogwarts  legacy website here which who knows if  it's gonna update in real time when best  buy and other places at it it does not  have any platforms listed for the pc  collector's edition now things are  faring better for the deluxe edition  you're starting to see this on steam  playstation xbox all the usual places  amazon has the listing up for it but it  is not yet available for sale best buy i  was able to get a pre-order in for the  deluxe on best buy's website so you  might want to try there if you're still  looking but then all of this is easily  forgiven you know stuff like this  happens you're working with a lot of  different retailers things like this  it's natural and just when we thought we  understood the different editions of  hogwarts legacy and what was included in  each one shout out to fearless vodka  over on the harry potter game subreddit  who made this little graph that you see  right here i thought this was the most  simple way of showing off what is in  each version but this has now changed as  well because what we have learned and  this is kind of the big deal going on  right now and that is that the  playstation version any playstation  version has an exclusive quest which was  not communicated to fans beforehand  before pre-orders went live before some  fans were dropping 300 on an xbox  version that doesn't include the  exclusive quest i mean that is probably  the most mind-blowing thing there when  you think about someone on xbox or pc  which pc collector's edition pre-orders  that i have seen have not went live yet  but for anybody who ordered the  collectors on gamestop for xbox had no  idea at the time they were ordering this  that they were going to be missing out  on this exclusive quest but it's not  just the exclusive quest apparently  playstation will also be getting the  felix felicis potion recipe of course  fans know this is the liquid luck potion  which hey i think that's awesome that's  going to be included in the game but is  it going to be locked out for all other  players i mean will this be a timed  exclusive will it eventually come to all  of her platforms or is this exclusive to  playstation forever then to take things  even more insane apparently there is an  amazon exclusive there's an amazon  edition of hogwarts legacy now i'm in  the us this is not on the us store yet  but you can find this listing on the  harry potter game subreddit and so far  it is on the french and german amazon  websites so here is a link of that  website right here which i think is  actually a pretty slick looking hat  right here but then right here edition  amazon what is going on are more  retailers going to have exclusive items  that we don't know about yet well if you  thought it was time for hogwarts legacy  to say something officially you're not  the only one because just before i hit  record on this video they actually put  up this statement here and i think it  was very much needed it starts off by  saying we're aware of the confusion that  has sparked following the role out of  pre-orders and we acknowledge and  apologize for the frustration caused in  our community the team hears you and  we'd like to provide some clarity on  questions that have come up regarding  collector's edition availability  collector's editions are going live with  our retailers on a rolling basis and  links are updated on hogwarts legacy.com  as we receive them now see i'm glad  they're saying this now but this is  something that would have definitely  been helpful to know before 11am on  thursday reading on here for clarity  pre-order of the ps4 and ps5 editions  standard deluxe digital deluxe and  collectors will come with the felix  felice's potion recipe all playstation  editions will come with the exclusive  quest no pre-order is required to obtain  it more information around sony  exclusives is coming soon i would expect  it sony's big event whenever they have  it that's when we're going to get that  and i know a lot of people were kind of  worried does this mean that it's not in  the physical playstation version no they  make it very clear here all playstation  versions will be getting the exclusive  quest reading on here regarding some  confusion around the dark arts pack and  potential micro transactions there are  no micro transactions in hogwarts legacy  players with the standard edition will  be given the option to purchase the dark  arts pack in game separately at launch  if they would like to upgrade there are  no other items for purchase in-game good  to get clarity on that as well a  wizarding world account or wb games  account is not required to play hogwarts  legacy this came from something that  appeared on steam for a little bit and  then they took it down i think it  actually made a lot of fans excited  because it was like hey can we actually  link this to our wizarding world and  bring over our patronus wand all those  sorts of things and i actually still  wouldn't rule that out i mean they say  not required here but they don't say  that it's not possible if this is  actually happening i think this would be  something great to reveal on back to  hogwarts day next week and then finally  again we'd like to reiterate that we  understand the frustrations around the  experience for the community yesterday  thank you for your continued excitement  and passion for hogwarts legacy okay  first off can we just give mad props to  chandler wood and the hogwarts legacy  team on this because this takes a lot to  stand up and do this and yes they've  made blunders they've made mistakes  they're stepping up they're owning to it  now we as a community as a fan base  we're gonna give them a chance to right  this wrong and to be completely fair  here the whole idea of exclusivity i'm  not a fan of it but i get it i mean it's  part of the industry i understand it it  happens on both sides all the companies  do this this is a normal thing my  biggest issue is that it just wasn't  communicated beforehand i mean if they  had made this known beforehand before  pre-orders went live before a 300  collector's edition went live then yeah  it wouldn't have been nearly as big of a  deal what people have still been upset  absolutely now we still need to know if  it's going to be a timed exclusive but  playstation is probably going to try and  keep that under wraps for as long as  they can and then the other thing that i  have tried to remind fans of time and  time again is that with a property like  harry potter which i know this is not a  harry potter game but being part of the  wizarding world there are so many  different parties that touch this guys  this is way above just avalanche right  here there are wb is involved porky  games is involved avalanche is involved  playstation is involved and then you  have all these retailers involved as  well so there are a lot of moving parts  here and things like this just generally  happen now the good news about most  pre-orders is that the vast majority of  companies will allow you to cancel your  pre-order so if you have learned  something in this video that makes you  want to change your pre-order check with  the retailer you purchase from and you  can very likely cancel that pre-order if  you need to maybe you want to cancel and  wait a while i wouldn't blame you if  you're new here be sure you hit that  subscribe button before you go i will  keep you up to date on all the latest  hogwarts legacy news theories discussion  as always thank you all so much for  watching i'll talk to you again soon
 

